    "title": "Tiffany Stratton & Lil Yachty Record What Might Just Be The Worst Rap Song Of All-Time (LISTEN) - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Ryan Clark ,\n1 hours ago\nTiffany Stratton added an unexpected new accomplishment to her resume on Wednesday, teaming up with rapper Lil Yachty to record a song live on Twitch.\nDuring the August 26, 2026 stream, the WWE Superstar jumped into the recording process and delivered a series of bars centered around her looks, success, and ambitions inside WWE. Naturally, Stratton made sure “Tiffy Time” was a major part of the track.\nREAD MORE: What Is Jacob Fatu Doing During His Off-Time These Days?, Total Divas Returning?\nREAD MORE: Myles Borne Lavishes Praise On Girlfriend Stephanie Vaquer\nTake a listen below – we’ll let you all decide how good or bad it is!\nNOTE: If you have any news tips or podcast recaps that you’d like to send in for us to post (full credit will be given to you), please email me at RClarkPWS@Yahoo.com .",
